    "result": "# shadcn/ui Select Component Documentation

## Overview
The Select component is a dropdown interface that "displays a list of options for the user to pick from—triggered by a button." It's available through both Radix UI and Base UI implementations.

## Installation
```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add select
```

## Core Imports
```javascript
import {
  Select,
  SelectContent,
  SelectGroup,
  SelectItem,
  SelectTrigger,
  SelectValue,
} from "@/components/ui/select"
```

## Basic Usage Structure
```jsx
<Select>
  <SelectTrigger className="w-[180px]">
    <SelectValue placeholder="Theme" />
  </SelectTrigger>
  <SelectContent>
    <SelectGroup>
      <SelectItem value="light">Light</SelectItem>
      <SelectItem value="dark">Dark</SelectItem>
      <SelectItem value="system">System</SelectItem>
    </SelectGroup>
  </SelectContent>
</Select>
```

## Component Hierarchy
The Select composition follows this structure:
- **Select** (root)
  - **SelectTrigger** → **SelectValue**
  - **SelectContent**
    - **SelectGroup** → **SelectLabel**, **SelectItem**
    - **SelectSeparator**

## Key Props & Features

**SelectContent position prop:**
- `position="item-aligned"` (default): Aligns popup with selected item
- `position="popper"`: Aligns popup to trigger edge

**Validation:**
- Apply `data-invalid` to Field component
- Apply `aria-invalid` to SelectTrigger for error states

## Example Patterns

**With Field Label & Error:**
```jsx
<Field data-invalid>
  <FieldLabel>Fruit</FieldLabel>
  <SelectTrigger aria-invalid>
    <SelectValue />
  </SelectTrigger>
</Field>
```

**Supporting Features:**
- Scrollable lists for many items
- Grouped options with SelectGroup
- Disabled items
- RTL language support
- Accessibility attributes

## Documentation Links
- [Radix UI Select API](https://www.radix-ui.com/docs/primitives/components/select#api-reference)
- [Installation Guide](/docs/installation)
- [Theming Documentation](/docs/theming)
- [RTL Configuration](/docs/rtl)",
    "durationMs": 4762,
    "url": "https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/components/radix/select"
  }
}

