    "result": "# Sidebar Component Documentation Summary

The shadcn/ui Sidebar is "a composable, themeable and customizable sidebar component" designed as a foundational element for application layouts.

## Installation
Install via: `pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add sidebar`

## Core Components & Structure

**Main composition hierarchy:**
- `SidebarProvider` — manages collapsible state and context
- `Sidebar` — the main collapsible panel
- `SidebarHeader` — sticky top section for branding/workspace switchers
- `SidebarContent` — scrollable content area
- `SidebarGroup` — sections with optional labels/actions
- `SidebarMenu/MenuItem` — navigation structure with links and badges
- `SidebarFooter` — sticky bottom section
- `SidebarRail` — resize handle

## Key Props

**SidebarProvider:**
- `defaultOpen` (boolean)
- `open` (boolean — controlled)
- `onOpenChange` (callback function)

**Sidebar:**
- `side`: "left" or "right"
- `variant`: "sidebar" | "floating" | "inset"
- `collapsible`: "offcanvas" | "icon" | "none"

## useSidebar Hook
Returns: `state`, `open`, `setOpen`, `openMobile`, `setOpenMobile`, `isMobile`, `toggleSidebar()`

## Keyboard Shortcut
Default: `cmd+b` (Mac) / `ctrl+b` (Windows)

## Theming
Uses CSS variables for customization: `--sidebar-background`, `--sidebar-foreground`, `--sidebar-primary`, `--sidebar-accent`, `--sidebar-border`, `--sidebar-ring`

## RTL Support
Updated with `dir` prop, `data-side` attributes, and physical positioning classes for bidirectional layouts.",
